### GET ALL DOCTORS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors

### GET ONE DOCTOR
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/3

### DELETE DOCTOR
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/3

### CREATE DOCTOR
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Artur",
  "phone": "553422346",
  "specialty": "Cardiologist",
  "experienceYears": 6
}

### UPDATE DOCTOR
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "Mykola",
  "phone": "34656354",
  "specialty": "Oncologist",
  "experienceYears": 22
}

### CHECK ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/admin

### CHECK USER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/user

### CHECK UNAUTHENTICATED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doctors/unauthenticated